Move Docker Storage to /data
Stop Docker service

bash
sudo systemctl stop docker
Move Docker data

bash
sudo mv /mnt/docker /data/docker
Create symlink

bash
sudo ln -s /data/docker /mnt/docker
Restart Docker

bash
sudo systemctl start docker
Verify new root directory

bash
docker info | grep "Docker Root Dir"
It should now show /data/docker.

.............
Permanent Fix: Move containerd storage
Stop Docker service

bash
sudo systemctl stop docker
Move containerd data to /data

bash
sudo mv /var/lib/containerd /data/containerd
sudo ln -s /data/containerd /var/lib/containerd
Restart Docker

bash
sudo systemctl start docker
Verify space usage

bash
df -h
You should now see /data handling both Docker and containerd storage.

